tempesta-xfw (1.1.0~pre1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Start the xFW if the logger was not started
  * Fixed IPv4 to IPv6 mapping
  * Allow tcp_auth_filter for gate mode
  * Reworked TCP options parsing
  * Fixed duplicated BPF maps
  * Added ip_proto filter support with GRE protocol
  * Updated xFW stats
  * Numerous technical improvements, cleanups and speedups

 -- Tempesta Technologies, Inc. <info@tempesta-tech.com>  Wed, 22 Jul 2026 13:00:00 +0000

tempesta-xfw (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Filter anomalous L2 IP4/IP6/ARP traffic
  * Filter anomalous L3 TCP/UDP/ICMP/ICMPv6 traffic
  * Intelligent protection for ingress/egress DNS traffic
  * Syncookie filter to protect against TCP attacks
  * tcp_auth_filter for unknown/unauthenticated traffic
  * tcp_flags filter to rate-limit packets with special flags
  * Rate limiting for incoming packets and bytes
  * Evaluating mode for testing purposes
  * Support for ClickHouse as a data logging backend

 -- Tempesta Technologies, Inc. <info@tempesta-tech.com>  Tue, 13 Jan 2026 15:00:00 +0000